stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "expired<br/>(key material wiped immediately)" as expired
    [*] --> pending: key escrowed
    pending --> active: key slot confirmed
    pending --> expired: no key slot within 24 h
    active --> superseded: rotation
    superseded --> retired: key slot removed
    retired --> destroyed: retention period ends
    expired --> [*]
    destroyed --> [*]
